usage: run_integration_four_tests.py [-h] --case
                                     {enemy-feedback-native,enemy-feedback-formal,enemy-feedback-support,enemy-corpse-save,enemy-corpse-snapshot,bgm-integration}

Run existing integration consumers with their own strict completion markers.
This adapter adds no assertions or acceptance claims. run_engine enforces
native exit, script/shader errors, timeouts and clean teardown; each original
consumer must also print its actual nonzero-check, zero-failure summary.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --case {enemy-feedback-native,enemy-feedback-formal,enemy-feedback-support,enemy-corpse-save,enemy-corpse-snapshot,bgm-integration}
